{"chapters":[{"title":"Plain recursion","code":"def min_falling_path_sum(matrix):\n    n = len(matrix)\n\n    def f(r, c):\n        if c < 0 or c >= n:\n            return inf\n        if r == 0:\n            return matrix[0][c]\n        return matrix[r][c] + min(f(r - 1, c - 1), f(r - 1, c), f(r - 1, c + 1))\n\n    return min(f(n - 1, c) for c in range(n))","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Plain recursion</strong> &mdash; O(n&middot;3<sup>n</sup>) time, O(n) extra space. Input: <code>min_falling_path_sum(matrix=[[-19, 57], [-40, -5]])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"matrix","label":"matrix","v":[["-19","57"],["-40","-5"]],"cls":[["",""],["",""]]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>n = len(matrix)</code> &mdash; <code>n = 2</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"matrix","label":"matrix","v":[["-19","57"],["-40","-5"]],"cls":[["",""],["",""]]}],"vars":[["n","2",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>def f(r, c):</code>","line":4,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"matrix","label":"matrix","v":[["-19","57"],["-40","-5"]],"cls":[["",""],["",""]]}],"vars":[["n","2",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>return min(f(n - 1, c) for c in range(n))</code> &mdash; calls <code>&lt;genexpr&gt;()</code>","line":11,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"matrix","label":"matrix","v":[["-19","57"],["-40","-5"]],"cls":[["",""],["",""]]}],"vars":[["n","2",0]],"stack":["min_falling_path_sum(matrix)","<genexpr>()"]},{"caption":"<code>return min(f(n - 1, c) for c in range(n))</code> &mdash; calls <code>f(r=1, c=0)</code>","line":11,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"matrix","label":"matrix","v":[["-19","57"],["-40","-5"]],"cls":[["",""],["src",""]]}],"vars":[["n","2",0],["c","0",1],["r","1",1]],"stack":["min_falling_path_sum(matrix)","<genexpr>()","f(r=1, c=0)"]},{"caption":"<code>if c &lt; 0 or c &gt;= n:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (c = 0, n = 2)","line":5,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"matrix","label":"matrix","v":[["-19","57"],["-40","-5"